  "notes": [
    "**Poner** is completely irregular",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form (pongo), otherwise regular -ER endings",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"pus-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"pon-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: irregular past participle **puesto**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"pondr-\" (not \"poner-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"pondr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Often used reflexively: **ponerse** (to put on clothing, to become)",
    "Common usage: *poner la mesa* (to set the table), *poner atención* (to pay attention)",
    "Many idiomatic uses: *ponerse nervioso* (to get nervous), *poner un negocio* (to start a business)"
  ],
